        "created_at": "2012-09-18T12:04:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… will find even more.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yep.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I don't have the time to go through it - sorry! (I probably won't even be able to make tonight's SotM gathering at the Arsenal…  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=12\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> )</p>",
