      {
        "id": 38607,
        "name": "logan_mann",
        "username": "logan_mann",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-18T14:38:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm attempting a project of mapping out all the quotes and comic lines.&nbsp; I'm still waiting for my 2nd Edition to arrive.&nbsp; I'll have both 1st and 2nd, but now don't know whether 1st should be considered accurate still.&nbsp; I'd hope it all is...that many more hints towards the wonderful multiverse.&nbsp; I guess I'll just hold off on everything though and wait til the 2nd Edition arrives and start with that.&nbsp; Then if &gt;G would at least let slip if 1st edition quotes are still real then I can go back and do those.</p>",
