      {
        "id": 38608,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-18T14:40:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I honestly don't see any reason why the flavor text from the core set would no longer be cannon.&nbsp; The gameplay functionality, yes, but not the flavor.&nbsp; The Enhanced Edition would simply contain more flavor text, not replacing the old.</p>",
