      {
        "id": 38611,
        "name": "broccoli",
        "username": "broccoli",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-19T19:08:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"flamethrower49\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> flamethrower49:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I will say it would have been cool to have different art on Apostate's two Gauntlets of Perdition.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Two? &nbsp;Now I'm curious to know what else has changed since playtest <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> &nbsp;I knew how the card worked had changed, but I was unaware that the card counts of his had changed as well. &nbsp;I can't wait to get my set and see what all I've been playing wrong <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>(The \"final proof\" sheet also didn't show the 5 -&gt; 3 change for Staff of Ra, that I read about in the other thread).</p>",
