      {
        "id": 38613,
        "name": "flamethrower49",
        "username": "flamethrower49",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-19T19:28:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"broccoli\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/48/1861_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> broccoli:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Two? &nbsp;Now I'm curious to know what else has changed since playtest <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> &nbsp;I knew how the card worked had changed, but I was unaware that the card counts of his had changed as well. &nbsp;I can't wait to get my set and see what all I've been playing wrong :)(The \"final proof\" sheet also didn't show the 5 -&gt; 3 change for Staff of Ra, that I read about in the other thread).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was quite surprised as well.&nbsp; It came up when I got a Profane Summons.&nbsp; I was telling the group that I didn't think there were any other relics in the deck, but out came another Gauntlet.&nbsp; When I registered surprise at this, Patrick raised his arms and said, \"Two hands.\"&nbsp; Which is why it would have been awesome to clearly show one as left hand and one as right hand.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Only three staves?&nbsp; That's news to me.&nbsp; I'll have to look at that.&nbsp; But I do know he had four before.</p>",
